!\n! Application defaults for xwatch.\n! --------------------------------\n!\n\n! Start up with a border or not: 0 or 1\n! Default: 0\n*border:		{{ border | default('0') }}\n\n! Geometry setting (e.g., 550x70+0+0)\n! Default: 400x70-2-175\n*geometry:              {{ geometry | default('400x70-2-175') }}\n\n! Start up with what background color\n! Default: skyblue\n*background:            {{ background | default('skyblue') }}\n\n! Print timestamp as xwatch sees new info: 0 or 1\n! Default: 0\n*printtime:		{{ printtime | default('0') }}\n\n! Number of lines that xwatch should store for scrollback: 10 to 1000\n! Default: 500\n*nlines:	      {{ nlines | default('500') }}\n\n! Issue warnings about files at startup: 0 or 1\n! Default: 0\n*firstwarnings:		{{ firstwarnings | default('0') }}\n\n! Hide lines containing some text. Separate strings by |\n! Default: last message repeated | Too much work at interrupt\n*gag:			{{ gag | default('last message repeated | Too much work at interrupt') }}\n\n! Special colorations when some string is matched in any logfile.\n! Syntax: color:string: | color:string\n! Default: red:finger connection: | blue:auth connection:\n*.colorstring:   {{ colorstring | default('red:finger connection: | blue:auth connection:') }}\n\n! Files never showing up in the xwatch-window. Separate multiple files by |\n! Default: /var/adm/mgetty-ttyS2.log\n*.ignore:   {{ ignore | default('/var/adm/mgetty-ttyS2.log') }}\n\n
